      "sourceTextSha256": "82bb491c7f04f73efa76de2d9ff39d5fa1f84a7dc17c7d081af7e5053215c383",
      "text": "Day 11 · A late-morning flight to Coca (30 minutes), a box lunch in town, then 2 hours by motorised canoe down the Napo River, a 30-minute walk through the forest and a paddle across Lake Pilchicocha to Sacha Lodge (arrival around 15:30–16:00). Swim in the lake, visit the butterfly house and, after dinner, take a night walk or a canoe ride to spot caimans. (B, L, D)\n\n–   Itinerary at Sacha Lodge may change depending on weather, interests and physical condition of guests.",
